  "ruleText": "Gcd 102.04 \"Wheelchair symbol\" means \"wheelchair symbol\" as defined in RSA 275-C:9, I (a), namely, \"the wheelchair symbol adopted by the Rehabilitation International's World Congress in 1969.\"\n\nSource. #7634, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10338, eff 5-17-13",
